      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To initiate the computer repair process, begin by examining the hardware."
      ],
      "justification": "The opening unit implicitly starts the process and describes the initial hardware examination step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "proceed with repairing any issues that were identified"
      ],
      "justification": "Directly corresponds to the first repair action following the initial examination."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
